  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support food security &amp; Livelihood of 1000 Ugandan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project  address food insecurity and livelihood in karamoja Uganda (Abim and Kotido). Through donor support will distribute agriculture inputs to 1000 beneficiaries 500 kotido and 500 Abim districts which are in a crisis of food shortage due to food insecurity, flooding, drought and farming practice in this community are very poor resulting into problem of food insecurity, poverty and environmental degradation. PERDL to provide technical guidance, training &amp; agriculture inputs as a solution.</narrative>
  </description>
